 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "It was about noon at Jacob's well, the sun was beating down",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I came to draw my water when nobody was around",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A tired Jewish stranger sitting quiet by the stone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Said give me a drink, and I said why ask me, you should leave me alone",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you knew the gift of God and who it is who speaks to you",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You would have asked him for a drink, and he'd have given you",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Living water, and I said sir, the well is deep and wide",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have nothing to draw with, where's the water you supply",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who drinks this water will be thirsty again",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But whoever drinks the water I give will never thirst again",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The water I give will become in them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A spring of water welling up to eternal life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sir, give me this water",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He told me everything I ever did, and still he did not go",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said the hour is coming when the true worshipers will know",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is spirit, and those who worship him must worship in spirit and truth",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I said Messiah is coming, and he said I am he",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who drinks this water will be thirsty again",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But whoever drinks the water I give will never thirst again",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The water I give will become in them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A spring of water welling up to eternal life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sir, give me this water",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I left my water jar and ran back to the town",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come and see a man who told me everything I ever did",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Could this be the Christ",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This man really is the Savior of the world",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Never thirst again",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 8.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
